# Next.js Environment Setup

This file documents the Next.js app setup and any additional configuration needed.

## Environment Variables

Create a `.env.local` file in the root directory for local development:

```env
# API Configuration
# NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:8000

# Add other environment variables as needed
```

## Notes

- `NEXT_PUBLIC_*` variables are exposed to the browser
- Other variables are only available on the server
- Environment variables must be set before build time for static generation
